s you to the job on the employer's site.","start":22.64849700000002,"end":25.96532350000001},{"text":"That's where you apply.","start":26.14507550000002,"end":27.226558400000044},{"text":"Then come back and mark it applied, and it moves to your Tracker.","start":28.085377199999982,"end":31.37612359999997},{"text":"Or decline it, or save it for later.","start":31.561948400000006,"end":33.70694040000001},{"text":"Jobs with low scores are hidden.","start":34.570143900000005,"end":36.34589689999996},{"text":"Tick show low scores to see everything the search found.","start":36.52542460000001,"end":39.24072080000002},{"text":"That's it.","start":41.96461790000001,"end":42.67335209999999},{"text":"You've gone from setup to your first list of jobs.","start":42.858953499999984,"end":45.4202669},{"text":"Next, try Searcher Mode, to run your searches automatically.","start":45.602118899999994,"end":49.07446570000002},{"text":"Thanks for watching.","start":49.25642739999995,"end":50.37034449999999}]}